## ⚠️ 关键表结构

### fact_order
- order_id, order_date, product_id, product_name, category, order_amount, region_id
- ❌ 没有 province 字段！

### dim_region
- region_id, province, city, district

### 关联条件
- ✅ fact_order.region_id = dim_region.region_id
- ❌ 禁止用 province 做关联！


